{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11110100","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11110100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1111010001:0":{"text":"이게 누구야! 워커, 새로운 파트너랑 같이 온 거야?","source_cn":"稀客啊。瓦尔克，这次带着新搭档来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x444B3E5D7D2C011A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111010002:0":{"text":"후, 다들 똑같은 소리를 하는군. 나한테 새로운 파트너가 필요해 보여?","source_cn":"唉，一个两个都是这样。我看起来很需要一个新搭档吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88DCA39AA7503A85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111010003:0":{"text":"널 보니까 예전 기억이 떠올라서 그렇지.","source_cn":"只是看到你，就会想起之前的日子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61D4FBF56AE02DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111010004:0":{"text":"너희가 그때 성공했다면 사막의 발톱, 이 미친놈들이 초코보를 타고 지금처럼 기승을 부리지 않았을 텐데!","source_cn":"要是你们当时成功了，流沙之爪，那群鸟背上的疯子，也不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBD747FA35829884","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111010005:0":{"text":"됐어, 추억팔이는 내 스타일은 아니지. 네가 찾던 사람을 데리고 왔어. 밖에서 안장을 내리고 있으니까 가봐.","source_cn":"算了，多嘴不是我的风格。你之前要找的人我带来了，在卸鞍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79B7EBB16DC4D4D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111010006:0":{"text":"고마워.","source_cn":"谢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6FE2A4DA303A36F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111010007:0":{"text":"아. 소렌, 미리 말해두지만, 잠시 후에 만날 사람 앞에서 충동적으로 행동하지 않았으면 해. 자칫하면 일을 그르칠 수도 있으니까.","source_cn":"顺便，索恩小兄弟，待会见了面别太冲动。太年轻气盛容易把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38DAC7E99396F352","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111010008:0":{"text":"...뭐라고?","source_cn":"……什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F8E24FF28861CCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111010009:0":{"text":"자, 이제 우리의 정보원을 만나러 가보자고.","source_cn":"走吧，去见见能给咱们情报的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC8059F8FDAAC4B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:“铁玫瑰”桑蒂":{"text":"“철의 장미” 샌디","source":"“铁玫瑰”桑蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"워커","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}